**Stack-specific:**

- FE: [../FE/frontend-rules-index.mdc](../FE/frontend-rules-index.mdc)
- BE: [../BE/backend-rules-index.mdc](../BE/backend-rules-index.mdc)

## When to use shared (not chỉ FE hoặc BE)

- Đổi `packages/api` (DTO, `I18nKey`, `ApiErrorPayload`)
- Endpoint mới xuyên web + api
- Đồng bộ error keys / messages EN + JA
- `pnpm build` / contract break ảnh hưởng cả monorepo
- Map FE feature manifest ↔ BE module manifest

## Workspace (summary)

| Path | Package | Role |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `apps/web` | `web` | Next.js UI |
| `apps/api` | `api` | NestJS API |
| `packages/api` | `@repo/api` | **Shared contract** (no DB) |
| `packages/database` | `@repo/database` | Prisma (when present) |
| `packages/ui` | `@repo/ui` | Shared UI |

## Conflict order

1. **Shared** contract (`@repo/api`, i18n keys, error shape)
2. **BE** structure / Prisma / Nest layers
3. **FE** App Router / feature layers / UI

